  "title": "And gold flushed more.",
  "html_source": "<p>Gold <strong><a href=\"https://genius.com/1368942/James-joyce-episode-11-sirens/Bronze-by-gold\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">once again</a></strong> refers to the blond Mina Kennedy and her flushed cheeks. She likes the strong liquor you see.</p><p><img src=\"https://images.genius.com/565d6bbeb1c9123f92fa77f7ee4a67d0.500x375x1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p><p>Of course this is also meant to be interpreted as the <strong>gold</strong> trumpet/horn <strong><a href=\"https://genius.com/1369020/James-joyce-episode-11-sirens/Imperthnthn-thnthnthn\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">alluded to earlier</a></strong> being blown.</p><p><img src=\"https://images.genius.com/a80b46a4d7c6732b8991a45fcff5ffb5.1000x625x1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>",
